{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Among the integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc38ee8b318e385356e1a581b4f2af8ca6dce699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2,\\dots , 1997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />,  what is the maximum number of integers that can be selected such that the sum of any two selected numbers is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In this list, there are 286 numbers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf26457c1fa8da0f6cf76544daf2a8038570f1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\bmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />, 286 numbers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d6b7ab193bd1c859d9dcab7aa59bbce2d6c124a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\bmod{7}$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, and 285 numbers for each of the other residues. From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greedy_Algorithm\" title=\"Greedy Algorithm\">Greedy Algorithm</a>, we can take all the numbers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf26457c1fa8da0f6cf76544daf2a8038570f1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\bmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />, then take all the numbers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d6b7ab193bd1c859d9dcab7aa59bbce2d6c124a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\bmod{7}$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, then all the numbers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e203133ce8f856cacf68ad7c1cbc9000e80af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\bmod{7}$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />. The inverses of these are 6, 5, and 4 modulo 7, respectively. Now we can take exactly one number that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e5cf4bdcd115bdd5dbdff9ceb00a92938f3b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\bmod{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />, but no more, because the inverse of 0 is 0. Therefore we can take a maximum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/2/ce2d7d896fc2be2c696144af8547e5f38515bcc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$286+286+285+1=\\boxed{858}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"23\" /> numbers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC\" title=\"1997 PMWC\">1997 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">Problem T7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">Problem T9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>